Oracle Clusterware is restarting database "STDBYCA" ...
Connected to an idle instance.
Connected to an idle instance.
Connected to "STDBYCA"
Continuing to reinstate database "stdbyca" ...
Reinstatement of database "stdbyca" succeeded

